WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.680 align:start position:19%
On the Oregon coast, the Pacific Ocean
is draining into a hole. Thor's well,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.599 align:start position:19%
waves crash in and vanish into the
earth. It looks bottomless, like a drain

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:13.440 align:start position:19%
pipe for the ocean. But it is not. The
hole is only 20 ft deep. Thousands of

00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:16.880 align:start position:19%
years ago, waves carved a sea cave into
the rock. Then the roof collapsed. Now

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:21.119 align:start position:19%
water rushes in through the bottom and
explodes back out 40 feet into the air.

00:00:19.359 --> 00:00:26.160 align:start position:19%
An endless loop of filling and draining.
Nature's wildest illusion. Hit subscribe

00:00:23.279 --> 00:00:26.160 align:start position:19%
for more strange tales.

